  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Request clarification",
   "texto": [
    "**Kan du si det en gang til?** («Can you say it again?») and **Kan du forklare det?** («Can you explain?») are common requests. **Langsomt** means «Slow down» and **tydelig**, «claramente».",
    "If you don't understand a word, you can ask **Hva betyr …?** («What does it mean?») or ask the person to say it another way: **Kan du omformulere?**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Explain a simple opinion",
   "texto": [
    "**Jeg mener at …** means «Creo que…» or «Opino que…». After **at**, the verb goes before **ikke**: **Jeg mener at oppgaven ikke er vanskelig**. In Spanish, the usual position is «I think the task is not difficult.»."
   ]
  },
